{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master of Balance is a text-driven workplace survival adventure game where you'll take on the role of a junior executive at a gaming company who, after being caught up in a strange magical incident, he must discreetly handle the business of daily life and work while investigating the truth behind what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of daily random events, Carefully balance the values of the five dimensions of boss, subordinates, family, health, and money by choosing different responses, every choice may reverse the situation in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/EN002.gif?t=1745561857\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Storylines\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy and witty main plot with different endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/EN003.gif?t=1745561857\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and addictive mini-game that can be played with just the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/EN004.gif?t=1745561857\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magical Abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of special abilities, free to mix and match, play in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras